{"seq":3,"slug":"constraints-axes","title":"约束与轴锁","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-drag-drop-interactions/behaviors/constraints-axes","wordCount":1289,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"约束与轴锁\">约束与轴锁</h1><p>不是每一次拖拽都该自由地满屏乱飞。调音台的推子只能上下推，时间轴上的片段只能左右挪，网格设计器里的方块要对齐到格点——这些都是给拖拽<strong>加约束</strong>。约束不是限制用户，而是把不可能的操作从一开始就排除，让交互更聚焦、更可控。这一篇讲三类最常见的约束——轴锁、边界、吸附——以及现代库如何把它们抽象成可组合的修饰器（modifier），让你能拼出任意规则。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-约束就是对-delta-的纯函数\">核心概念：约束就是对 delta 的纯函数</h2><p>约束的实现有一个统一而优雅的模型，理解它这一篇就通了一半：回忆<a href=\"../foundations/dnd-model\">《拖放数据模型》</a>里拖拽物的位置由相对位移 <code>delta</code> 决定、渲染成 <code>translate3d(delta)</code>。那么<strong>任何约束，本质都是在渲染前对 <code>delta</code> 做一次纯函数变换</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mtext>delta</mtext><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>delta</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{delta}&#x27; = f(\\text{delta})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8362em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">delta</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8362em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.1473em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">delta</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>轴锁、边界、吸附无非是三个不同的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span>。因为是纯函数，它们天然可组合——把多个约束依次套用，就是函数复合 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>delta</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_3(f_2(f_1(\\text{delta})))</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">delta</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)))</span></span></span></span></span>。这正是 dnd-kit 把约束做成 <code>modifiers</code> 数组、按序应用的理论基础。本篇后面三节分别给出这三个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span> 的具体形式，最后讲组合。</p>\n<h2 id=\"轴锁-把二维拖拽压成一维\">轴锁：把二维拖拽压成一维</h2><p>轴锁（axis lock）限制拖拽只能沿单一方向。纵向轴锁把水平分量清零，横向反之：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mtext>lockY</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><msub><mi>f</mi><mtext>lockX</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_{\\text{lockY}}(\\{x, y\\}) = \\{0,\\ y\\} \\qquad f_{\\text{lockX}}(\\{x, y\\}) = \\{x,\\ 0\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">lockY</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">({</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mclose\">})</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">lockX</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">({</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mclose\">})</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>轴锁的价值不只是&quot;限制&quot;，更是<strong>消除歧义</strong>。在一个既能纵向排序、又想避免误触横向滚动的列表里，锁定纵轴能让拖拽意图干净利落。它也常用于滑块、进度条、时间轴这类语义上本就一维的控件。实现只需在每帧应用位移前，把被锁轴的分量置零，一行代码，却极大提升手感确定性。</p>\n<h2 id=\"边界约束-不许拖出容器\">边界约束：不许拖出容器</h2><p>边界约束（restrict to bounds）把拖拽物钳制在某个矩形内——通常是它的父容器或指定区域。做法是对位置做 <code>clamp</code>（截断到区间）。设容器允许的位移范围为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[x_{\\min}, x_{\\max}]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span>，则：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x&#x27; = \\min(\\max(x, x_{\\min}), x_{\\max})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8019em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8019em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span> 同理。范围本身由容器矩形减去拖拽物自身尺寸算出，保证元素整体不越界。dnd-kit 提供现成的 <code>restrictToParentElement</code>、<code>restrictToWindowEdges</code>、<code>restrictToFirstScrollableAncestor</code> 等修饰器覆盖常见需求。要注意边界约束与自动滚动的交互——若既限制在容器内、又想拖到容器外的位置，二者语义会打架，一般不同时启用（见<a href=\"auto-scroll\">《边缘自动滚动》</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"吸附-对齐到网格或参考线\">吸附：对齐到网格或参考线</h2><p>吸附（snapping）让拖拽物落点对齐到离散位置，最常见是网格吸附。设格距为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>g</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span>，把连续位移四舍五入到最近的格点：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>g</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">round</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mi>g</mi></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x&#x27; = g \\cdot \\operatorname{round}\\!\\left(\\frac{x}{g}\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8019em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8019em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">round</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1076em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8804em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>吸附让设计工具、看板、日程表这类&quot;位置有意义&quot;的界面变得整齐可控。进阶形态是<strong>参考线吸附</strong>（对齐到其它元素的边缘或中线），Figma、白板类应用大量使用——原理相同，只是吸附目标从固定格点换成动态计算的一组候选线，取距离最近且在阈值内的那条。吸附常配合轻微的视觉/触觉反馈（对齐时闪一下参考线），提示用户&quot;咬住了&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"组合-修饰器管道\">组合：修饰器管道</h2><p>真实需求往往是多约束叠加：既锁纵轴、又限制在容器内、还吸附到网格。修饰器模型让这变成一条管道，按顺序把 <code>delta</code> 依次变换：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[原始 delta 来自指针位移] --&gt; B[modifier1: 轴锁 lockY]&#10;  B --&gt; C[modifier2: 边界 clamp 到容器]&#10;  C --&gt; D[modifier3: 吸附 snap 到网格]&#10;  D --&gt; E[最终 delta prime]&#10;  E --&gt; F[渲染 translate3d]\">flowchart TD\n  A[原始 delta 来自指针位移] --&gt; B[modifier1: 轴锁 lockY]\n  B --&gt; C[modifier2: 边界 clamp 到容器]\n  C --&gt; D[modifier3: 吸附 snap 到网格]\n  D --&gt; E[最终 delta prime]\n  E --&gt; F[渲染 translate3d]</pre><p>顺序有讲究：一般先轴锁、再边界、最后吸附，因为吸附后的坐标仍需落在边界内。下表小结三类约束：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>约束</th>\n<th>变换 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span></th>\n<th>典型 API（dnd-kit）</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>轴锁</td>\n<td>分量置零</td>\n<td><code>restrictToVerticalAxis</code></td>\n<td>一维控件、消歧</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>边界</td>\n<td>clamp 截断</td>\n<td><code>restrictToParentElement</code></td>\n<td>防拖出容器</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>吸附</td>\n<td>round 到格点</td>\n<td>自定义 modifier</td>\n<td>网格/参考线对齐</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>因为每个修饰器都是纯函数，测试极简单：给定输入 <code>delta</code> 断言输出，无需模拟真实拖拽。这种可组合、可测试的特性，也是为什么该用成熟库而非手写散乱 if 判断，详见<a href=\"../practice/dnd-libraries\">《库 (dnd-kit)》</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>一切约束都是对相对位移 <code>delta</code> 的纯函数变换 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>delta</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(\\text{delta})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">delta</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，因而天然可组合（函数复合），这是修饰器模型的理论基础。</li>\n<li>轴锁把某个分量置零，既是限制也是消除歧义，适合一维语义控件。</li>\n<li>边界约束用 <code>clamp</code> 把位置钳在容器内，与自动滚动语义冲突时一般不同时启用。</li>\n<li>吸附把连续位移 <code>round</code> 到最近格点或参考线，让&quot;位置有意义&quot;的界面整齐可控。</li>\n<li>多约束按&quot;轴锁→边界→吸附&quot;顺序组成修饰器管道；纯函数特性让它极易测试。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>上一篇：<a href=\"auto-scroll\">《边缘自动滚动》</a> —— 边界约束与自动滚动的语义冲突。</li>\n<li>本 hub：<a href=\"../foundations/dnd-model\">《拖放数据模型》</a> —— delta 与纯函数变换的来源。</li>\n<li>跨库：<a href=\"../../frontend-state-machines-statecharts/statecharts/states-transitions\">《状态与转移》</a> —— 约束下的合法状态转移建模。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"约束与轴锁","id":"约束与轴锁"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：约束就是对 delta 的纯函数","id":"核心概念-约束就是对-delta-的纯函数"},{"level":2,"text":"轴锁：把二维拖拽压成一维","id":"轴锁-把二维拖拽压成一维"},{"level":2,"text":"边界约束：不许拖出容器","id":"边界约束-不许拖出容器"},{"level":2,"text":"吸附：对齐到网格或参考线","id":"吸附-对齐到网格或参考线"},{"level":2,"text":"组合：修饰器管道","id":"组合-修饰器管道"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"边缘自动滚动","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-drag-drop-interactions/behaviors/auto-scroll"},"next":{"title":"键盘与无障碍拖放","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-drag-drop-interactions/practice/dnd-accessibility"}}